  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Shop?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/31/Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20140703172317\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"The shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"The shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"233\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The shop</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>shop</b> (also called the <b>market</b>) is where players can buy <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fields</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> and their <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shelters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">trees and bushes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production buildings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service buildings</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a>.\n</p><p>Items in the shop cost <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using the shop</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/76/Shop_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20240126131957\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shop Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"172\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The shop can be accessed by touching the cash register icon on the bottom left of the screen.\n</p><p>The shop has 5 tabs to buy things from:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fields</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal shelters</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production buildings</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/service-buildings-24540\" title=\"Service Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Service buildings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/trees-and-bushes-7454\" title=\"Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Trees and bushes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Decorations</a></li></ul>\n<p>Players can purchase items by touching and dragging them onto available space in the farm or the town.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Decoration filters</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Decorations</a></i>\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a> tab has sub-filters:\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-slideshow wikia-gallery floatright\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-wrapper\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-images-wrapper\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-prev-next\"><a class=\"wikia-slideshow-prev\" title=\"Previous photo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a class=\"wikia-slideshow-next\" title=\"Next photo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></div><ul class=\"wikia-slideshow-images neutral\"><li class=\"wikia-slideshow-first-image\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"All\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">All</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Nature\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Nature</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Farming\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Farming</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Ornaments\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Ornaments</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Fences &amp;amp; Paths\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Fences &amp; Paths</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Rewards\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Rewards</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Sanctuary\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Sanctuary</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Cost coins\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Cost coins</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Cost diamonds\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Cost diamonds</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Cost vouchers\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Cost vouchers</div></div></li><li><a class=\"image lightbox\" title=\"Expand slideshow\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"thumbimage\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" alt=\"Stored items\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Stored items</div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-toolbar\"><div><span class=\"wikia-slideshow-toolbar-counter\">1/11</span></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Storing decorations</b></span></h3>\n<p>Player can store decorations they have bought. They need to:\n</p>\n<ol><li>Touch and hold the decoration until the rotate and store icons appear.</li>\n<li>Touch the store button (i.e. the box icon)</li></ol>\n<p>Players can place stored decorations back the usual way.\n</p><p>When more then one item is stored, the shop records how many of each it holds. Players must use stored items first, before buying another.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters (467 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2e/Chicken_Coop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713110707\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters (467 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Category:Animal Shelters (467 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Barn.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250926033811\" title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\